  "about": {
    "title": "About the Legendary Collection set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Legendary Collection is a Legendary Collection expansion released on 24 May 2002. It has 110 cards: 110 in the main set and 0 secret rares. There are also 104 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 110 main set cards) or the <b>Master set</b> (214 cards, adding the reverse holos).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
